"本機訪客可不註冊使用帳本；選用 Apple 或 Email 登入後，帳目保存在該帳號獨立的裝置空間。雲端備份與還原需由你主動操作，不是即時雙向同步。移除 App 或遺失裝置可能造成資料遺失，請定期備份。" = "Guest ledgers work without registration. Apple or email sign-in uses separate account storage on this device. Cloud backup and restore are manual, not live two-way sync. Removing the app or losing the device can lose data; back up regularly.";
"你主動使用雲端備份時，攤商資料、財務紀錄、配方、備忘與舊版封存會傳送至本 App 的 Firebase 服務，依登入帳號限制存取。Firebase Authentication 處理登入識別與 Email；Firestore 保存帳本備份。這不是端對端加密服務。匯出或分享的檔案由你選擇位置保管；訂閱到期仍可匯出裝置資料。" = "When you choose cloud backup, vendor data, financial records, recipes, notes and legacy archives go to this app's Firebase service with account-based access. Firebase Authentication handles sign-in identifiers and email; Firestore stores backups. This is not end-to-end encryption. You choose where to keep exported files. Device data can still be exported after subscription expiry.";
"你可編輯帳目，於帳號頁申請刪除帳號與雲端資料，並自行刪除已匯出的檔案。刪除帳號不會取消 Apple 訂閱。配方照片在裝置上辨識；目前備份保存辨識文字與配方，不保存原始照片。本 App 未整合廣告或 Google Analytics；Apple 與 Firebase 可能依各自政策處理服務所需的帳號、網路與安全資訊。支援信箱：grost9999@gmail.com。" = "Edit entries or request account and cloud-data deletion in the account screen. Delete exported files yourself. Account deletion does not cancel Apple subscriptions. Photos are recognized on-device; backups contain text and recipes, not original photos. No ads or Google Analytics are integrated. Apple and Firebase may process necessary account, network and security information under their policies. Support: grost9999@gmail.com.";
"確認訂閱後，將依所選方案收費並自動續訂。請於當期結束至少 24 小時前取消，以免續訂。實際價格與扣款日期以 App Store 確認畫面為準。" = "After confirmation, your selected plan is charged and renews automatically. Cancel at least 24 hours before the period ends. The App Store confirmation screen determines actual price and billing date.";
